data capture_35810323032_summary: String = "UEFI RC version: 1.08\r\nSCP FW version    : 1.08\r\nSCP FW build date : 20210825\r\nFailsafe status                 : 0\r\nReset status                    : 3\r\nCPU info\r\n    CPU ID                      : 413FD0C1\r\n    CPU Clock                   : 2800 MHz\r\n    Number of active sockets    : 1\r\n    Number of active cores      : 80\r\n    Socket[0]: Core voltage     : 1065\r\n    Socket[0]: SCU ProductID    : A10001\r\n    Socket[0]: Max cores        : 80\r\n    Socket[0]: Warranty         : 0\r\n    Socket[0]: Subnuma          : 0\r\n    Socket[0]: RC disable mask  : 0\r\n    Socket[0]: AVS enabled      : 1\r\n    Socket[0]: AVS voltage      : 1027\r\nSOC info\r\n    DDR Frequency               : 2666 MHz\r\n    Socket[0]: Soc voltage      : 750\r\n    Socket[0]: DIMM1 voltage    : 1235\r\n    Socket[0]: DIMM2 voltage    : 1235\r\n    PCP Clock                   : 1550 MHz\r\n    SOC Clock                   : 2000 MHz\r\n    SYS Clock                   : 400 MHz\r\n    AHB Clock                   : 200 MHz\r\n"

